    "notes": [
      "IncentiveRewards 3rd-party feed is not implemented (InComm 2026-07-20 Q4). Track R uses a research-generated IncentiveRewards-shaped ledger on real members/gaps/amounts. It is not InComm-issued; Milestone 7 may use it only as labeled research input.",
